        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Matt Stone, Trey Parker, Casey Nicholaw\n- TV Series: South Park\n- Episodes: \"Jared Has Aides\", \"Professor Chaos\"\n- Places: Utah\n- Productions: The Book of Mormon\n- Characters: Butters\n\nFacts:\n- South Park is an American animated television series created by Matt Stone and Trey Parker.\n- South Park takes place in Colorado, and it includes the episode \"Jared Has Aides\".\n- Trey Parker co-directed The Book of Mormon with Casey Nicholaw.\n- In South Park's 86th episode, \"Professor Chaos\", Butters devises schemes to take over the world.",
