        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "32b23fe7-eb04-5484-8e4b-22c4879dea5b",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: South Park, The Simpsons, Monty Python's Spamalot, The Book of Mormon\n- Episodes: Simpsons Already Did It, Professor Chaos, Jared Has Aides\n- People: Trey Parker, Matt Stone, Casey Nicholaw\n- Topics: South Park season 6, television episodes, choreography, co-direction\n\nFacts:\n- South Park season 6 of the American animated television series South Park began airing on March 6, 2002.\n- Jared Has Aides is the first episode of the sixth season of South Park.\n- Simpsons Already Did It is the seventh episode of South Park season 6 and the 86th episode of South Park overall.\n- Simpsons Already Did It continues the events of the previous South Park episode Professor Chaos.\n- In Simpsons Already Did It, Butters devises schemes to take over the world and discovers that each scheme has already appeared on The Simpsons.\n- South Park was created by Trey Parker and Matt Stone.\n- Casey Nicholaw choreographed Monty Python's Spamalot in 2005.\n- Casey Nicholaw choreographed The Book of Mormon in 2011 and won for co-directing it with Trey Parker in 2015.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
        "original_id": "ada745c9-98c1-516e-8140-aa780df11cc3",
        "text": "Page: Simpsons Already Did It. Sentence: \"Simpsons Already Did It\" is the seventh episode of the sixth season of the American animated television series \"South Park\", and the 86th episode of the series overall.\nPage: Simpsons Already Did It. Sentence: In the episode, which continues on from the events of the previous episode \"Professor Chaos\", Butters thinks up a series of schemes to take over the world, but realizes that each one has already been performed on \"The Simpsons\".\nPage: South Park (season 6). Sentence: Season six of \"South Park\", an American animated television series created by Trey Parker and Matt Stone, began airing on March 6, 2002.\nPage: Jared Has Aides. Sentence: \"Jared Has Aides\" is the first episode of the sixth season of the adult American animated television series \"South Park\".\nPage: Casey Nicholaw. Sentence: \" (2015), for choreographing \"Monty Python's Spamalot\" (2005), and choreographing \"The Book of Mormon\" (2011), winning for his co-direction of the latter with Trey Parker.",
        "type": "DocumentChunk"
